Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.51,0:00:16.51,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\blur75\fad(200,200)\pos(943.214,826.545)}使用AI工具翻译，如有不准确的地方请在弹幕或评论区指正，谢谢！\N！！真的有人看不到这行字！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.79,0:00:26.79,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur75\fad(200,200)\pos(972.357,817.785)}翻译质量权威评价：原来25年就有小拉即用机翻糊弄人了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,《我的世界》是一款奇妙的游戏 \NMinecraft is a weird game,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.88,0:00:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,其中许多设定都让人摸不着头脑 \Nand there's a lot of features that don't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.64,0:00:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,雨滴并非从云层中坠落\NRain doesn't fall from clouds,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.42,0:00:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,装有熔岩的炼药锅竟能置于水下 \Nlava cauldrons can be underwater,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.52,0:00:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,切石机居然毫无杀伤力？\Nand stone cutters deal no damage?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.94,0:00:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,所以今天我将为大家盘点《我的世界》里50个令人费解的设定 \NSo today I bring you 50 things that don't make any sense in Minecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.42,0:00:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,《我的世界》里的降雨设定毫无科学依据 \NMinecraft rain makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.72,0:00:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,当你飞越雨雪纷飞的云层时 \NWhen you fly above the clouds when it's raining or snowing,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.66,0:00:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你会发现降水其实并非来自云层 而是源自无限高的天际 \Nyou'll learn that the weather doesn't actually come from the clouds and instead comes from the infinite sky above.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.52,0:00:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,确实 云层纯粹是装饰作用 \NI guess the clouds are just there for show.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.76,0:00:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,《我的世界》里的树木设定完全不合常理 \NWood in Minecraft doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,比如活板门和门就存在这种现象\NOne example would be trapdoors and doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.02,0:00:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,当你合成一扇门时 \NWhen you craft a door,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.16,0:00:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,用6块木板就能造出3扇门 \Nyou get 3 doors from 6 planks of wood,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.54,0:00:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,而制作活板门时 却只能得到2个 \Nyet with a trapdoor, you only get 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.70,0:00:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,但活板门用材量相同 体积却只有门的一半\NAnd considering trapdoors use the same amount of wood and are half the size,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.44,0:00:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这确实不太合理 \Nit doesn't make much sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.92,0:00:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你不觉得沙漠生态紧挨着冰雪苔原的生成特别有意思吗？\NDon't you just love it when a desert biome generates right next to a snowy tundra?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.38,0:00:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然《我的世界》的地图是随机生成的 \NWhile Minecraft worlds are random,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.08,0:00:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,确实 最炎热的生态群落与最寒冷的比邻而居 实在有违常理 \Nit doesn't make much sense for one of the hottest biomes to spawn next to one of the coldest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.82,0:00:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道什么在Minecraft中是没有意义的吗？\NDo you know what makes no sense in Minecraft?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.14,0:00:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是泡沫柱\NBubble columns.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.18,0:01:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不管出于什么原因 他们总是倒着的\NFor whatever reason, they work backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,岩浆块会产生热量 理论上应该使你上升 但恰恰相反 会将你拉下\NMagma blocks generate heat which in theory should cause you to rise but does the opposite and pulls you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.36,0:01:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,再说灵魂沙\NThen you have soul sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.80,0:01:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,在下界行走时会让人陷进去\NIn the nether, it sucks you down when you walk across it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.68,0:01:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,可它在气泡柱里\Nyet with bubble columns,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.84,0:01:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,却能托着人往上升\Nit causes you to rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,据说MC世界是无限大的\NA Minecraft world is supposedly infinite,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.94,0:01:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那日月为何能在地平线移动呢？\Nso how does the sun and moon pass on the horizon?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.74,0:01:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,难道它们会直接穿透整个世界吗？\NDo they just smash through the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.40,0:01:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,它们究竟去了哪里？\NWhere do they even go?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.78,0:01:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,从哞菇身上直接获取蘑菇煲真是个实用的功能 \NHaving the ability to grab mushroom stew from mooshrooms is a pretty handy feature.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.32,0:01:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,说到底 这些源源不断的蘑菇汤究竟从何而来呢？\NBut let's be real, where does this stew all come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.02,0:01:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这简直是取之不尽 而且完全没解释来源 \NIt's an infinite supply with basically no explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.14,0:01:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Minecraft 最大的错误之一就是留下一棵漂浮的树 \NOne of the biggest Minecraft sins is to leave a floating tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.10,0:01:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你 没错 就是你\NAnd I know that you, yes you,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.90,0:01:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你至少干过一次这事 \Nhave done it at least once.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.54,0:01:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这功能虽然方便 但细想之下确实毫无逻辑可言 \NHowever, the fact that this exists doesn't make sense at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.58,0:01:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是 这棵树是怎么漂浮起来的？\NI mean, how is this tree even floating?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.74,0:01:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,确实相当奇怪 \NIt's just really weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.14,0:01:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,《我的世界》似乎对哪些方块受重力影响有着选择性设定 \NMinecraft just seems to pick and choose which blocks are affected by gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.06,0:01:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,比如你可以用石头在空中搭建平台 \NI mean, you can literally build up into the air with stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.60,0:01:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,即便敲掉脚下的石块 \Nbreak the stone below you,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.94,0:01:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你依然能安然悬浮在半空 \Nand you'll just float with no issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.68,0:01:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,但要是换成沙砾或沙子这么操作 \NTry this with gravel or sand though,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.44,0:01:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,结局可就不太美妙了 \Nand it's not gonna end nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.62,0:02:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,在早期版本中 \NIn older versions of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.40,0:02:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,玩家居然能用火焰合成锁链盔甲 \Nyou were able to craft chainmail armor with fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.42,0:02:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这本身就够离谱了 \NNow this already made no sense,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,而Mojang移除了这个设定\Nand Mojang removed this feature,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.70,0:02:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,但更离谱的还在后面\Nbut it gets even more silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.28,0:02:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,如今锁链盔甲只能通过生物掉落获取\NSo nowadays, chain armor is only obtainable through mob drops,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.82,0:02:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,可游戏里明明已经加入了锁链道具\Nbut Mojang have since added chains into the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.18,0:02:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,却依然无法合成锁链盔甲\Nyet there's still no way to craft chain armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.58,0:02:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这实在说不通\NI mean, that doesn't make much sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.42,0:02:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,草方块永远不会被踩坏\NGrass blocks can't be trampled.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不论你如何踩踏\NDespite how much you walk on them,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.62,0:02:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,跳跃甚至火烧\Njump on them, or burn them,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.50,0:02:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,它们始终保持着草方块形态\Nthey'll always remain as grass blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.64,0:02:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这实在说不通 \NTo me, this makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.30,0:02:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,因为草方块本质上就是带草皮的泥土块\NHow is a grass block so tough that it can't be turned into dirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.80,0:02:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,说到异常坚固的方块\NSpeaking of weirdly tough blocks,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.96,0:02:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛网也难以被破坏 \Ncobwebs aren't easily broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.62,0:02:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,任何生物或玩家穿过蜘蛛网都不会使其破损\NAny mob or player that passes through the cobweb will not break it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.18,0:02:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这简直\Nwhich is just...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.72,0:02:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,完全不合常理啊\Nhow does that even make sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.26,0:02:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你唯一能轻松摧毁蜘蛛网的方式是使用剪刀或剑\NThe only way you're destroying a cobweb easily is with shears or swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.46,0:02:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,另一个不合理之处是 投射物能够毫无问题地穿透蜘蛛网\NAnother thing that doesn't make sense with cobwebs is that projectiles are able to pass through them with no issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.18,0:02:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,但玩家或生物穿过时\NBut if a player, a mob,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.64,0:02:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,或是物品靠近蜘蛛网时\Nor an item goes anywhere near a cobweb,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.76,0:02:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,就会被粘住 移动速度变得极其缓慢 \Nthey are caught and move incredibly slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.12,0:03:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,更离谱的是 蜘蛛网还能保护敌对生物白天不被阳光灼伤\NAnother thing that makes no sense is that cobwebs are able to protect hostile mobs from burning during the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.10,0:03:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你是想告诉我这个空心的\NYou mean to tell me this hollow,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.68,0:03:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪的是 某种异常坚固的蛛网竟然能阻挡太阳的热量？\Nstrangely durable cobweb somehow has the power to prevent heat from the sun?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.84,0:03:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这么一说倒挺合理\NYeah, makes sense I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.98,0:03:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 这根本说不通啊\NOh wait, it doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.32,0:03:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 这期视频就是要吐槽这些设定\NThat's the whole point of this video.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.74,0:03:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,水和岩浆接触会生成黑曜石\NDoes water and lava make obsidian,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.98,0:03:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,石头还是圆石？\Nstone, or cobblestone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.54,0:03:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,答案是三种都会生成 \NThe answer is it makes all three.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.12,0:03:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,具体生成哪种取决于水和岩浆的接触方式 \NDepending on where you place the water and lava,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.66,0:03:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这三种材料都能通过这种方法制造\Nyou can make all three of these materials,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.84,0:03:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,要我说这实在有点不合常理 \Nwhich if you ask me, doesn't make a lot of sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.22,0:03:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,更离谱的还在后面：\NThe strange behaviour doesn't stop there,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.20,0:03:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你在水下放置炼药锅倒入岩浆 \Nbecause if you place lava in a cauldron underwater,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.98,0:03:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,它并不会变成圆石 \Nit doesn't turn into cobblestone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.96,0:03:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,相反 岩浆就这么静静待在...\NInstead, the lava just kind of sits there,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.02,0:03:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道的...在水底下 \Nyou know, underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.58,0:03:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 这很科学 \NYeah, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.56,0:03:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,同样地 把炼药锅直接放在海里也不会自动装满水  \NAlso, placing a cauldron in the ocean itself doesn't fill up the cauldron.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.70,0:03:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管这个炼药锅完全被汪洋大海所包围  \NDespite this cauldron literally being surrounded by oceans of water,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.62,0:03:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你却必须亲自用桶装水来填满它  \Nyou have to fill it up yourself with a water bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.96,0:03:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 现在来聊聊红石电路  \NOkay, let's talk about redstone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,红石中继器究竟是如何运作的？  \NHow does a redstone repeater actually work?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,它是个发电机吗？  \NIs it a generator?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.62,0:03:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,它自身有能量来源吗？  \NDoes it have a power source?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.94,0:03:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,当红石信号逐渐减弱时  \NWhen the redstone signal becomes weaker,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.14,0:03:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以通过中继器来延长信号传输距离  \Nyou extend the redstone signal by using a repeater.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.00,0:04:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但若没有能量来源 中继器根本无法工作\NBut the repeater doesn't work without a power source,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.24,0:04:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那这个怎么会输出满格信号呢？\Nso how is this outputting a max signal strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.92,0:04:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我不想假装自己是红石专家\NLook, I won't pretend I'm a redstone expert,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.20,0:04:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但这逻辑实在让我难以理解\Nbut that doesn't really make sense to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.04,0:04:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,诡异木和绯红木都不会燃烧\NBoth warped and crimson stems don't burn,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.66,0:04:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这很合理 因为它们生成在《我的世界》最炽热的环境\Nwhich makes sense as they generate in the hottest place in Minecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.00,0:04:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但说不通的是 你居然能用这些防火木材来制作营火\NBut what doesn't make sense is that you can use these blocks to create a campfire,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.32,0:04:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,明明这些木块本该是防火的啊\Ndespite these blocks supposedly being fireproof.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.24,0:04:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,垂直移动时\NWhen traveling vertically,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,普通梯子根本不够用\Nregular ladders just aren't gonna cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,试试攀爬含水梯子吧\NInstead, try climbing a waterlogged ladder,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.08,0:04:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,因为某种神秘机制\Nas for whatever reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.16,0:04:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你会比爬普通梯子更快\Nyou'll climb faster than you would on a regular ladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.98,0:04:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,按理说水流不是应该阻碍行动吗？\NI mean, shouldn't this water be weighing you down?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.16,0:04:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这怎么说得通呢？\NHow does this make sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.62,0:04:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,美西螈在水中迅捷灵活\NAxolotls are fast in water,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.48,0:04:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,在陆地上却行动迟缓\Nbut very slow on land.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.88,0:04:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,但只要你给美西螈系上拴绳\NBut as soon as you attach a lead to an axolotl,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.20,0:04:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,它们立刻在陆地上健步如飞 仿佛要征服世界\Nthey're suddenly much faster on land and ready to conquer the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.84,0:04:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然有违常理\NIt doesn't really make sense,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.32,0:04:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但这个特性确实深受喜爱\Nbut we do love this feature.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.48,0:04:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,在《我的世界》里 你可以在海洋\NIn Minecraft, you can fish from the ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.00,0:04:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,河流 池塘甚至1x1的水坑垂钓\Nrivers, ponds, and a 1x1 hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但最神奇的是\NBut you know what's weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.76,0:05:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这个巴掌大的水坑竟能源源不断提供鱼类和各种物品\NSomehow this small 1x1 hole of water can provide you with infinite fish and various items.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.88,0:05:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,说真的 这些东西到底从哪儿来的？\NSeriously though, where does it all come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.10,0:05:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管看起来更破碎\NDespite appearing more broken,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.02,0:05:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,开采圆石却比普通石头更费时\Ncobblestone takes longer to mine than regular stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.18,0:05:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏里所有工具都能顺利采集对应矿石\NAll tools in Minecraft can break their respective ores without any issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.66,0:05:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,直到我们遇到金质工具\NThat is until we come to gold tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.84,0:05:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,无论你多努力尝试\NNo matter how hard you try,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.38,0:05:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,用金镐挖金矿 永远挖不到 \Nyou're never going to get gold by mining with,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.08,0:05:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,金子\Nwell, gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.22,0:05:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,铁傀儡和雪傀儡的生成条件非常特殊 \NIron golems and snow golems are very specific.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.42,0:05:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,确实如此 这些生物只有最后放置南瓜头时才会生成 \NThis is because these mobs will not spawn unless you place the pumpkin on its head last.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.34,0:05:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,若先摆放南瓜再堆砌身体结构 \NIf you try to place the pumpkin before the other blocks,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.82,0:05:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,它们不会生成 这确实不合常理\Nthey will not spawn, which doesn't really make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.54,0:05:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你大概以为铁砧是个坚不可摧的方块\NYou would think an anvil is a pretty strong block.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.06,0:05:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,确实如此 它们压扁玩家时可是毫不留情\NI mean, they have no issue squashing the player.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.36,0:05:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,但若将铁砧置于火把\NBut put an anvil up against a torch,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.64,0:05:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,花卉或树苗之上 铁砧就会瞬间掉落\Nflower, or sapling and the anvil will lose and break instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.84,0:05:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,但不知为何\NBut for whatever reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.06,0:05:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但枯死的灌木丛却总能被铁砧压得粉碎 \Na dead bush will always lose to an anvil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.62,0:05:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,信标确实令人费解 \NBeacons make no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.52,0:05:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管合成配方中加入了黑曜石\NDespite having obsidian in the crafting recipe,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,信标却能被赤手空拳轻易摧毁\Nbeacons are easily able to be destroyed by using your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.68,0:06:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,谁能想到黑曜石打造的方块竟如此不堪一击？\NWho would have thought a block made of obsidian could be destroyed so easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.36,0:06:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,栅栏确实有点奇怪 毕竟你没法直接跳过它们 \NFences are a bit strange as you can't jump over them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.24,0:06:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但若在栅栏上铺块地毯\NHowever, once you place a carpet on top of a fence,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.02,0:06:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你却能轻松跃过 尽管此时方块在技术上变得更高了\Nyou're able to jump it with ease even though the block is now technically higher up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.48,0:06:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,TNT 末影水晶和苦力怕可算是《我的世界》里最致命的几种存在了 \NTNT, end crystals, and creepers are some of the most deadly things you can deal with in Minecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.22,0:06:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,但这片小小的树叶就能让它们全部失效\NBut this single leaf block can render them all completely useless,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.72,0:06:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,只要在脚下放上一片\Nsince if you place one at your feet,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.28,0:06:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,就能完全抵消爆炸伤害\Nit will negate all damage from the explosions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.82,0:06:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,草径和耕地有些奇特特性\NPath blocks and farmland have some odd behaviour.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.70,0:06:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不知为何无法放置火把或灯笼\NFor some reason, you can't place torches or lanterns,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.62,0:06:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,却能插告示牌挂锁链\Nbut you can place signs and chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.54,0:06:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不过放置这些会使方块变回泥土\NHowever, placing either of these will turn the block back into dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.38,0:06:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但末地烛却是例外\NBut then you have end rods.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.94,0:06:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,若将其插在草径上\NIf you place them on path blocks,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.52,0:06:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不会让草径变回泥土\Nit doesn't change it back into dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.38,0:06:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这游戏确实存在逻辑矛盾\NThis game really has a consistency issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,众所周知下界不能存在水\NIt's a well-known fact that water doesn't belong in the nether.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.42,0:06:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,试图放置时\NIf you attempt to place it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.66,0:06:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,水流会瞬间蒸发\Nit will instantly evaporate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.36,0:06:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,但若将水盛入下界中的炼药锅\NHowever, if you place water into a cauldron in the nether,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.70,0:06:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,却完全不会出现问题\Nthere doesn't seem to be a problem in doing so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.98,0:07:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,石材切割机上的巨型锯片能将石头切割成各种形状\NThis giant saw blade from the stone cutter is capable of cutting stone into various shapes and sizes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.02,0:07:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,可当玩家站上这巨型锯片时\NBut somehow, if the player stands on the giant saw blade,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.14,0:07:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,竟毫发无伤\Nit doesn't seem to harm you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.14,0:07:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这实在有违常理\NThis just makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.82,0:07:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,浆果丛能致命\NA berry bush can kill you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.18,0:07:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,而锋利锯片却无害？\Nbut this can't?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.40,0:07:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,僵尸猪灵不会在岩浆中燃烧\NZombified piglins cannot burn in lava,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.32,0:07:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧？\Nright?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.90,0:07:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,但在基岩版中若将它们放进盛有岩浆的炼药锅\NIf you place them in a cauldron filled with lava on Bedrock Edition,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.64,0:07:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,它们虽会冒火却不受伤害\Nthey start to burn, but don't take any damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.62,0:07:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,看来基岩版的僵尸猪灵不太适应岩浆浴\NI guess zombie piglins don't enjoy lava as much on Bedrock Edition.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.32,0:07:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,说到基岩版\NSpeaking of Bedrock Edition,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.98,0:07:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这个版本有个特性：能用活塞移动箱子等方块实体\Na feature exists in this version where you can move tile entities such as chests by using pistons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.62,0:07:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,此功能未加入Java版实在令人费解\NWhy this feature isn't in Java Edition doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.54,0:07:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你说岩浆该有多烫？\NHow hot would you say lava is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.32,0:07:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,相当炙热对吧？\NPretty hot, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.18,0:07:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,岩浆能吞噬周遭一切可燃之物\NNow, lava will burn anything and everything in its surroundings,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.76,0:07:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但岩浆块却似乎不会引燃任何东西\Nbut a magma block doesn't seem to burn anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.06,0:07:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这实在不合常理 毕竟岩浆块理应比流动岩浆更炽热\NThis makes no sense, as magma is meant to be hotter than lava,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.86,0:07:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,却偏偏不具备燃烧特性\Nyet it doesn't burn anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.40,0:07:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,更诡异的是：潜行站在岩浆块上竟能毫发无伤\NAnother weird feature with magma blocks is the ability to crouch on them and not take any damage when you do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.70,0:07:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这究竟是如何实现的？根本说不通嘛\NI mean, how does this even occur or even make sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.82,0:08:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,熔炼盔甲堪称 Minecraft 最坑设定之一\NSmelting armor is one of the biggest scams in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.04,0:08:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,完全违背常理\Nand it doesn't make any sense either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.84,0:08:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,因为当你熔炼一件铁胸甲时 \NThis is because if you smelt an iron chestplate,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.22,0:08:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,比如熔炼铁胸甲只能得到一颗铁粒\Nfor example, you get one iron nugget in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.40,0:08:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟制作胸甲时消耗了整整8块铁锭\NThis is a scam because the chestplate was originally worth 72 iron nuggets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.02,0:08:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,冰霜行者附魔堪称渡河越海的神器\NThe Frostwalker enchantment can be great for crossing rivers or oceans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.92,0:08:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,唯独对含水层水域施展冰霜行者会完全失效\NThe only water you shouldn't use Frostwalker on is waterlogged water,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.82,0:08:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,无论你如何尝试 这种水域始终无法结冰\Nas it will never freeze no matter how hard you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.70,0:08:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,从高空坠落时\NWhen you fall from great heights in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.24,0:08:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你完全能用各种方式自救\Nyou're able to save yourself with all kinds of methods.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.10,0:08:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但羊毛或海绵这类方块  无法提供任何坠落保护\NHowever, blocks such as wool or sponge cannot save you from any fall damage,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.72,0:08:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但不知为何\Nbut for whatever reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.92,0:08:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,干草块却能缓冲坠落伤害\Nhay bales can.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.92,0:08:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,ojang再次随心所欲地决定哪种方块能救命\NOnce again, Mojang just picks and chooses which blocks will save your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.04,0:08:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,拉弓射箭时 箭矢能穿透方块间的狭窄缝隙\NWhen shooting a bow, you're able to shoot through small gaps between blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.08,0:08:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至能穿过栅栏门的缝隙\NYou can even shoot through fence gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.96,0:08:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但不知为何\NBut for whatever reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.12,0:08:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,明明栅栏和红树木活板门间隙更大 箭矢却无法穿透\Nyou can't shoot through fences or mangrove trapdoors despite there being a big gap in between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.54,0:08:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,玩家能与村民的每个交易站点进行独特互动\NThe player can interact with every villager trading station in a unique way,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.02,0:08:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,但不知为何\Nbut for whatever reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.14,0:09:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,唯独无法与制箭工作台交互\Nyou can't interact with the fledging table.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.60,0:09:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜ojang完全忘了这个工作台的存在 毕竟这是唯一没更新的村民专用方块\NI think Mojang just forgot about the fledging table because it's literally the only villager block they haven't updated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.28,0:09:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,碎裂下界砖无法在下界要塞自然生成\NCracked nether bricks cannot be found naturally in a nether fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.96,0:09:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,制作这种方块需要\NIn order to make these blocks,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.14,0:09:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,用熔炉烧制普通下界砖\Nyou need to heat them in a furnace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.34,0:09:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,难道不觉得碎裂下界砖本该自然生成于下界吗？\NSo don't you think cracked nether bricks should naturally generate in the nether?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.72,0:09:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟整个维度都浸泡在岩浆海里\NI mean, the dimension is made of literal lava,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.00,0:09:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这很合理吧\Ncome on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.50,0:09:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,堆肥桶能将任何天然材料转化为骨粉\NComposters can turn any natural material into bone meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.12,0:09:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但令人费解的是\NBut what doesn't make sense is that for whatever reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.78,0:09:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,明明竹子100%可生物降解 却不知为何无法制成骨粉\Nbamboo cannot be turned into bone meal despite being 100% biodegradable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.96,0:09:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,末影龙能摧毁游戏中的许多方块\NThe ender dragon is capable of destroying many blocks in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.92,0:09:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,而末地城黑曜石柱\NWhen it comes to obsidian,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.02,0:09:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,更具体地说\Nmore specifically the pillars,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.80,0:09:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,它直接穿过不会摧毁\Nthey won't destroy it and will instead phase straight through them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.76,0:09:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但末影箱却会被破坏\NBut it will however destroy ender chests,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这很不合理 末影箱由8块黑曜石合成\Nwhich doesn't make a lot of sense as ender chests are crafted with 8 obsidians,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.96,0:09:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,按理说强度应该是普通黑曜石的八倍\Nso it should be 8 times stronger than your regular obsidian block.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.68,0:09:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,下界合金装备作为游戏最强护甲能让玩家战力倍增\NNetherite armour is the strongest armour in the entire game that can make the player very powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.14,0:10:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,但遇到仙人掌或浆果丛时\NHowever, when it comes to cacti or berry bushes,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.26,0:10:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,防护竟会失效并受伤\Nyou're not protected and will take damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.36,0:10:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧？这种弱不禁风的灌木能伤到我？\NI mean, come on, how is this pathetic bush damaging me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.42,0:10:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们早就确认岩浆具有极高温度\NWe've established by now that lava is pretty hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.46,0:10:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但当头顶有岩浆块时\NHowever, if there's a lava block above you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.80,0:10:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,滴落的炽热岩浆直接接触皮肤居然不会造成伤害\Nit will drip through but doesn't damage the player even though this is an incredibly hot liquid landing directly onto your skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.96,0:10:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这符合常理吗？\NI mean, how does this make sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.84,0:10:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,从高处坠入水中能安全着陆不受伤害\NLanding in water from a great height is a nice way to land safely without taking any damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.24,0:10:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但若将水盛入炼药锅\NBut put that water in a cauldron,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.94,0:10:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,重复同样操作结果却截然不同\Ntry the same thing again and I think you'll find you'll have a much different outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.80,0:10:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这又作何解释？\NI mean, how does this make sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.28,0:10:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你终究还是落入了水中\NYou're still landing in water,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.56,0:10:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吗？\Nright?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.06,0:10:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,破坏村庄对多数玩家算是趣事\NRaiding villages seems to be a pretty fun pastime for most players.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.02,0:10:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但村民作何感想？\NBut what do the villagers think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.82,0:10:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他们似乎完全无动于衷\NWell, it seems like they just don't care at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.20,0:10:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以践踏庄稼\NYou can ruin their crops,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.66,0:10:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,偷窃 杀人 甚至拆毁房屋他们都面不改色\Nsteal, murder and even destroy their homes and they're just unfazed by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.94,0:10:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,桶是个相当强大的物品 因为它可以装下海量的水\NThe bucket is a pretty powerful item as you can hold insane amounts of water,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.66,0:10:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,岩浆 积雪与牛奶\Nlava, snow and milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.52,0:11:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但难以理解的是 能用铁桶盛装岩浆 这铁桶却会被岩浆或火焰销毁\NBut what doesn't make a lot of sense is that you're able to hold lava in a bucket but then you can destroy the bucket in lava or fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.38,0:11:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,而火焰温度还远不及岩浆\NAnd considering fire isn't even as hot as lava,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,铁桶至少该能抵御这种程度的损伤\Nsurely the bucket should at least survive that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.60,0:11:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,众所周知下界合金制成的工具与盔甲具有完全防火特性\NAs you know, netherite tools and armour are completely fireproof.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.04,0:11:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,任何程度的岩浆与火焰都无法损毁这些装备 \NNo amount of lava or fire will ever destroy these items.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.08,0:11:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果你把它们扔向仙人掌\NBut if you throw them at a cactus,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.70,0:11:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,它们便会瞬间损毁 \Nthey'll be destroyed instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.34,0:11:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,要我说 这完全不符合下界合金这种顶级材质的强度设定\NWhich if you ask me, makes no sense for items as strong as netherite.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.34,0:11:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,想了解《我的世界》里有哪些稀世珍宝吗？\NWant to learn what some of the rarest things in Minecraft are?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.50,0:11:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,想了解的话 就点击右侧视频观看吧 \NWell, you can do so by watching the video right here.
